            <description><![CDATA[<p>⚡ <strong>The running border now lights up for the Copilot CLI.</strong></p>
<h3>🐛 Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>🟡 Prompting Copilot from the terminal now lights the running border around the notch, the same as Claude Code and Codex.<br>
Before, only the Copilot desktop app's sessions showed. A session open in both places counts once.</li>
<li>🍺 <code class="notranslate">brew install</code> / <code class="notranslate">brew upgrade</code> no longer prints a deprecation warning about the cask's <code class="notranslate">verified</code> parameter.</li>
</ul>
<p>💬 Tell me what breaks: <a href="https://tokenpacer.com/#feedback" rel="nofollow">https://tokenpacer.com/#feedback</a></p>]]></description>
